  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The 3.5 rebuilder fails initialization during the spring bean loading phase.  The problem is ServletContext is not in the classpath.  Further investigations shows that the culprit is AttributeFinderModule#setServletContext(ServletContext cxt).   This method seems to be superfluous, as the context is never used.  Simply removing it fixes the problem.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Additionally, loading of akubra module fails due to the rebuilder looking for the llstore ModuleConfiguration rather than the Module itself.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
